 *
 * constⒶNT collection page — route: /collections/constant/
 * Pixel-parity rebuild 2026-05-27 per pixel_parity prompt §B.
 *
 * Architecture: manual composition pattern (same as multi-family/index.astro)
 * — uses shared collection components for all standard sections
