 * CFG-CHROME-2: No .mockup-banner.
 * CFG-TYPE-1: Lato + JetBrains Mono pinned with !important.
 * CFG-INV-1: No inventory counts. SKU counts only.
 * CFG-COPY-4/-5/-6: No competitor brands, no vendor MPNs, no OEM mentions.
